---
import Section from '../../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section
	title={{ text: "Hire Employees Worldwide", translateKey: "sectionHeadings.hireEmployeesWorldwide" }}
	description={{ text: "Simplify the hiring process for employees and freelancers with Garna. Unlike other companies, we will resolve not only the financial, but also legal side while you are looking for the right specialists", translateKey: "sectionDescriptions.hireEmployeesWorldwide" }}
	class="border-y border-[#020202]/0" headerClass="mb-16 max-w-5xl lg:mb-20" titleClass="mx-auto max-w-4xl lg:text-5xl" contentClass="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"
>
<div class="glass-card transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#0c0c0c] group bg-[#0c0c0c] rounded-2xl pt-8 pr-8 pb-8 pl-8">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#5EA500]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#5EA500] mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="globe" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-globe w-6 h-6"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" class=""></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20" class=""></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-light text-white mb-3 font-sans tracking-tight">Quick Global Employment</h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-base text-gray-500 font-light font-manrope">Hire employees anywhere in the world without setting up local legal entities</p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#0c0c0c] group bg-[#0c0c0c] rounded-2xl pt-8 pr-8 pb-8 pl-8">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#5EA500]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#5EA500] mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="plane" aria-hidden="true" class="w-6 h-6">
        <path d="M17.8 19.2 16 11l3.5-3.5C21 6 21.5 4 21 3c-1-.5-3 0-4.5 1.5L13 8 4.8 6.2c-.5-.1-.9.2-1.1.7l-1.2 3.6c-.1.5.3 1 .8 1l5.5 1.4-3.8 3.8-2.6-.9c-.4-.1-.8.2-1 .6L.6 19.5c-.1.4.3.9.8.8l3.1-1.3 3.8-3.8 1.4 5.5c.1.5.6.9 1.1.8l3.6-1.2c.5-.2.8-.6.7-1.1z"></path>
    </svg>
</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-light text-white mb-3 font-sans tracking-tight">Immigration Assistance</h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-base text-gray-500 font-light font-manrope">We help you not only find talent, but also apply for a visa and permanent residence support</p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#0c0c0c] group bg-[#0c0c0c] rounded-2xl pt-8 pr-8 pb-8 pl-8">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#5EA500]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#5EA500] mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="building" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-building w-6 h-6"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M9 22v-4h6v4"></path><path d="M8 6h.01"></path><path d="M16 6h.01"></path><path d="M12 6h.01"></path><path d="M12 10h.01"></path><path d="M12 14h.01"></path><path d="M16 10h.01"></path><path d="M16 14h.01"></path><path d="M8 10h.01"></path><path d="M8 14h.01"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-light text-white mb-3 font-sans tracking-tight">Flexible Worksite Coverage</h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-base text-gray-500 font-light font-manrope">Hire for offices, retail, factories, or remote teams: wherever your business operates</p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#0c0c0c] group bg-[#0c0c0c] rounded-2xl pt-8 pr-8 pb-8 pl-8">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#5EA500]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#5EA500] mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="headset" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-headset w-6 h-6"><path d="M3 11h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5Zm0 0a9 9 0 1 1 18 0m0 0v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3Z"></path><path d="M21 16v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-5"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-light text-white mb-3 font-sans tracking-tight">24/7 Support</h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-base text-gray-500 font-light font-manrope">Our support team is available 24/7 to resolve any issue in just a few minutes</p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#0c0c0c] group bg-[#0c0c0c] rounded-2xl pt-8 pr-8 pb-8 pl-8">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#5EA500]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#5EA500] mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="blocks" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-blocks w-6 h-6"><rect width="7" height="7" x="14" y="3" rx="1"></rect><path d="M10 21V8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v12a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H3"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-light text-white mb-3 font-sans tracking-tight">Seamless Integration</h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-base text-gray-500 font-light font-manrope">Garna integrates seamlessly with your existing HR processes and accounting payroll software</p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#0c0c0c] group bg-[#0c0c0c] rounded-2xl pt-8 pr-8 pb-8 pl-8">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#5EA500]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#5EA500] mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="gift" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-gift w-6 h-6"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="4" rx="1"></rect><path d="M12 8v13"></path><path d="M19 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7"></path><path d="M7.5 8a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5A4.8 8 0 0 1 12 8a4.8 8 0 0 1 4.5-5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-light text-white mb-3 font-sans tracking-tight">Employee Benefits</h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-base text-gray-500 font-light font-manrope">A user-friendly personal dashboard for every team member: access to payslips, vacation management, and expense tracking in real time</p>
        </div>
</Section>
